    {
      "description": "This panel explains what is happening in simple terms, what to watch for, and why it matters.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Read Me\nThis Grafana workspace monitors your macOS system with Prometheus + node_exporter.\n\nDashboards:\n- Mac System: Core Health — CPU, memory, disk usage (including External-SSD + Time Machine), disk I/O\n- Mac Network: Connectivity & Wi‑Fi — throughput, errors/drops, ping health, Wi‑Fi signal/rates\n- Mac Info: Identity & Status — system identity, key specs, running launchd services\n- All Metrics: Live Explorer — all active Prometheus metrics (live only)\n\nRetention:\n- Prometheus data retention: 14 days\n- Storage cap: 20 GB\n\nExporters and launchd:\n- node_exporter (Homebrew service)\n- Custom exporters (launchd): net_connectivity, system_info, launchd_metrics\n- Root daemon: wdutil_metrics for Wi‑Fi metrics\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Read Me",
      "type": "text",
      "id": 10
    },
    {
      "description": "Shows key identity facts like OS version, hardware model, CPU, memory, IP address, and Wi‑Fi name. Helpful for quick system overview without digging into system settings. Missing series are unavailable, not zero. Optional hardware, unmounted disks, stopped VMs and inactive collectors may have no samples.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(mac_system_kv)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "title": "System Information",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "valueLabel": "value"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "indexByName": {
              "key": 0,
              "value": 1
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table",
      "id": 11,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Unavailable"
        }
      }
    },
    {
